    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d207">

                <pb facs="1256" n="1098" xml:id="pg1098"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Thompson
                        to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-09-29"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 29,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram of yesterday. Article 5, paragraph 2, reads “The inspection and
                    jurisdiction of the federal authorities may extend into the sea for fiscal
                    purposes up to a distance of 20 kilometers, measured from the line marked by low
                    tide on the coasts of the Republic.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">D. E. Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>




